1
00:00:00,787 --> 00:00:03,877
(Sheldon:)Oh, that sounds terrible.
Why would I want to do that?

2
00:00:05,525 --> 00:00:09,895
(Amy:)That's right,
they're no good without the lighter.

3
00:00:11,131 --> 00:00:13,621
(Sheldon:)So much for your advice
on complimenting Penny.

4
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,320
Why, what happened?

5
00:00:15,502 --> 00:00:18,702
(Sheldon:)She tried to rope us into going to her
acting class to see a play.

6
00:00:18,905 --> 00:00:22,935
(Sheldon:)Don't worry, luckily I had the good sense
to drown that kitten in the river.

7
00:00:25,212 --> 00:00:28,542
(Amy:)Sheldon, that's very rude.
She helped you with your show.

8
00:00:28,715 --> 00:00:31,705
(Amy:)The right thing to do is reciprocate
by going to see her play.

9
00:00:32,819 --> 00:00:34,789
(Sheldon:)Oh, so many crazy rules.

10
00:00:38,692 --> 00:00:41,682
(Amy:)That better be Tootsie Rolls
you're throwing at me!

11
00:00:44,631 --> 00:00:45,891
(Sheldon:)Penny.

12
00:00:46,066 --> 00:00:47,326
(Sheldon:)Penny.

13
00:00:47,501 --> 00:00:50,031
(Sheldon:)Penny.
Oh, yeah, much better.

14
00:00:51,872 --> 00:00:52,892
(Raj:)What?

15
00:00:53,073 --> 00:00:56,633
(Sheldon:)Amy pointed out to me that
since you did something nice for me...

16
00:00:56,810 --> 00:00:59,300
(Sheldon:)...I'm obligated to do something
nice for you.

